                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-indent:39px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:16px">为</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">深入贯彻习近平总书记关于教育的重要论述和落实</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">全</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">国教育大会精神，根据《中共中央、国务院关于深化新时</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">代教育评价改革总体方案》等文件精神，结合《绍兴市</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">五</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">好</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学生</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”评价指导性意见》</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">坚持</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五育并举”，落实立德树</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">人根本任务，健全促进学生全面发展的教育评价体系，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">学校立足实际，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">特</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">制</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">订</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">评选工作方案</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px;position:relative;top:-3px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px;position:relative;top:-3px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、指导思想</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">以</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，坚持党</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">和</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">国家的教育方针政策，贯彻促进学生全面发展的教育理念，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">全面落实《中小学生守则》、中小学生日常行为规范、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">社</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">会</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">主义核心价值观和学生核心素养发展要求，深化新时代学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">评价改革，进一步推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中小学</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五育并举”，培养“德智体</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">美劳</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”全面发展的学生</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">二、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">评选组织</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校建立党组织书记为组长的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">学生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">”</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">推优</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评选工作领导小组，负责</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”评价工作方案</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">的制订、宣传和实施</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">长：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">王</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">琛</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">副组长：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">孙洪亮</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">蒋</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">明</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">俞奇弘</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">员：</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">刘明玉</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">冯王亮</span>   <span style="font-family:宋体">何隽豪</span>   <span style="font-family:宋体">平建树</span>   <span style="font-family:宋体">王佩金</span>    <span style="font-family:宋体">金</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">笛</span>   <span style="font-family:宋体">茹奕蓓</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">施笑程</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">钟慧军</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">王月琴</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px;position:relative;top:-1px"><span style="font-family:宋体">三</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px;position:relative;top:-1px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">评选</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">原则</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">导向性原则。根据学生成长规律和教育规律，着</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">力克服评价</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">唯分数、唯升学，重智育、重结果</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”的倾向，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">落</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">实学生综合素质评价，促进学生全面而有个性发展。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（二</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">全体性原则。坚持面向全体学生，坚持</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">因</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校制宜，让每个学生都有争做</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”的机会，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">让更多的学生通过努力达到</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”的标</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">准。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">公正性原则。坚持实事求是、客观公正，强化过</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">程性评价和发展性评价，评价程序合理，评价主体多元，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">评</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">价方法科学，有效发挥评价</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">的引导、诊断、改进、激励功能。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">四</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">可行性原则。坚持评价内容全面、指标清晰、学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">易</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">懂，符合不同学段学生的成长发展特点。注重基层组织</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">的</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">过程管理，定性与定量相结合，鼓励积极运用信息技术辅</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">助</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">评</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">价工作，提高评价的可操作性。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:30px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">四</span><span style="font-family:宋体">、评</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">选</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">标准</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">品德好。主要评价学生理想信念、社会责任、尊</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">师孝亲、行为习惯等方面的表现，重点关注学生爱党爱国</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">诚实守信、团结友善、遵纪守法等品德行为，参加班集体</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">活</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">团队活动、社会公益活动的情况。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（二</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">学习好。主要评价学生学习品质、学习方法、学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">习</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">习</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">惯、学业水平等方面的表现，重点关注学生乐学善学、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">勤</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">于</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">反思、敢于质疑、热爱阅读、信息整理等学习行为，具</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">有</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">良好的学业水平。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">身心好。主要评价学生体质健康、运动能力、生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">活习</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">惯</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、情绪管理等方面的表现，重点关注学生安全自护、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">日常</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">锻</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">炼、体育特长、人际交往等情况，关注学生应对困难</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">和挫</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">折</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">的能力，将体质测试、近视防控和心理健康列入关键</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">指</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">标。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（四</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">审美好。主要评价学生艺术感知理解、欣赏表达、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">实践</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">创</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">作等方面的表现，重点关注学生形成正确的审美情趣，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">修</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">习书法、美术、音乐、舞蹈、戏剧等基础性艺术课程等行为，参加艺术社团和培养艺术特长情况</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（五</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">劳动好。主要评价学生劳动精神、劳动态度、劳</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">动习</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">惯</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、实践能力等方面的表现，重点关注学生参加日常校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">园劳</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、家务劳动等行为，参与学工学农、研学实践、志愿</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">服</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">务等校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">内</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">外劳动实践教育活动等情况。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">五</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">、评</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">选</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">实施</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">选范围</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">绍兴一中</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">在籍在校学生。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（二</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">选时间</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">每</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">学年推选</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">一次</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">市直</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">“五好</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学生</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">安排在</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">下</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">个学期结束前</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">选数量。每学期以班级为单位推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">选</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">在符合校级五好学生基础上</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">高一、高二</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">平行班</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每班推荐</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1人</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">创新班每班推荐</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">人</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:33px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">（四</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">推荐</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-1px;font-size:16px">程序</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">六</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">、评定办法</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">1.市</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">直</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">级</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”由各年级管委会根据</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">上级</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">分配的名额，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">在各班推荐</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">的基础上，按比例推选。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">2.校评选工作领导小组根据教育局</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">以及学校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">评审方案对各年级推选的名单进行讨论、筛选、评定，通过之后在校园网公示。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">3.学校公示无异议后，将正式入选学生名单上报市教育局。经市教育局审核认定且公示无异议后，由市教育局公布表彰、颁发证书。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">4.对于在</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">各个方面</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">有突出成绩的学生，可由校长直接提名表彰。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">本</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">工作方案</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">自</span> 2022 学年第</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">二</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">学期起施行。</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:275px;text-align:right;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">绍兴市第一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">中学</span></p><p style="text-indent:267px;text-align:right;line-height:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">202</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">3</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">年</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">6</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">月</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:23px"><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:23px"><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">绍兴市第一</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">中学</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">市</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">直级</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">“五好学生”</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">推优</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">评</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">选</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:21px">指标指引</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">一、品德好</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">爱国，爱党，遵守法规，遵守社会公德，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">遵守校纪校规，积极践行社会公德</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，助人为乐、热心公益，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在校内外的日常行为规范起示范作用，服务集体（工作积极，出色，有贡献）</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">2.孝敬父母，尊敬师长，热爱集体，团结同学，大方友善，举止文明； </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">3.积极参与各类爱党爱国活动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，追求进步，积极学习党、团知识；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">4.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">有良好的独立生活方式、交往方式和文明修养，获学校、家庭、社区的好评</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">.</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">上学期及本学期两次品德考评必须</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">均为</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">A</span><span style="font-family:宋体">等</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">6. </span><span style="font-family:宋体">本学年受处分，一票否决。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">二、学习好</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">1.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">学习目标明确，进取心强，学习有规划，有愿景；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">2.<span style="font-family:宋体">学习习惯好，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">能</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">科学安排学习</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">时间</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，自觉完成学习任务；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学习品质好，上课能仔细聆听、善于思考</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，积极参与课堂讨论</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">懂得学习分享与交流，能够与人合作，取长补短，共同进步</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">学习成绩好，各科成绩优秀，</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">综合名次在年级前</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">25</span><span style="font-family:宋体">％或总成绩班级前</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">40%</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">三、身心好</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">1.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">身体健康，热爱体育活动，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每天</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">进行体育</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">锻炼；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">2.<span style="font-family:宋体">有健康的兴趣爱好，积极参加体育社团，学习、掌握</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">至少</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">2 <span style="font-family:宋体">项运动技能；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">3.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">心理健康，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有良好的情绪控制力，生活</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">、</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学习上有一定的承受力、耐挫力；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">积极参加</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">体育课、课间操、课外活动、军训、远足等锻炼</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">积极参加各类体育比赛和各级体质测试，为集体争光；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5.</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">学年体育达标成绩必须达到良好及以上</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">（本学期体测成绩达</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">80</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分及以上</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">）</span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">，具有良好的体育精神和心理品质（体育任课教师参与评价），</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">本学年</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">运动健康综合素质考评达到</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">B</span><span style="font-family:宋体">等及以上</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">四、审美好</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">1.<span style="font-family:宋体">认真参加音乐、美术等艺术类课程</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">和</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">劳技等学科</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">的学习</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，考核成绩</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">须良好及以上；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">有一定的审美情趣，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学习并掌握至少</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">项艺术兴趣爱好；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">能积极参与</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">教室软板设计，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">学校校园文化设计等各类设计活动，积极参与美丽教室或文明寝室争创工作</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">.</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">积极参加</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校内艺术</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">类</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">社团</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">且</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">表现</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">良好；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">.<span style="font-family:宋体">积极参加</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">校内</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">艺术类表演或评比活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">或</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校外艺术类表演或评比活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">6.</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">本学</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">年</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">艺术素养综合素质考评达到</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">B</span><span style="font-family:宋体">等及以上</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">五、劳动好</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">.<span style="font-family:宋体">卫生习惯良好，自觉维护校园环境卫生</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">认真做好班级</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">、寝室</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">值日工作；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">.<span style="font-family:宋体">生活节俭、爱惜粮食，节约水电，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">无</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">浪费行为</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">积极参加社会实践、社区服务活动，研学活动等；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">积极参加校内外志愿服务工作，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在志愿者服务等公益活动中起示范带头作用</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">在</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">学校、班级组织开展的各种教育活动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">如</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">推广垃圾分类、公筷公勺、光盘行动、文明城市或校园</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">建设</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等活动中表现突出</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">6.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">本学</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px">年</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">创新实践综合素质考评达到</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">B</span><span style="font-family:宋体">等及以上。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:23px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">六、加分指标</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在全面发展的基础上，某方面有突出贡献、突出成绩、突出表现</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">如：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">获得县（市）级及以上综合荣誉，学科类竞赛获奖，科学小发明、小创造获得专利，个人见义勇为等事迹受到媒体报道</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">等</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 267px;line-height: 28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 267px;line-height: 28px">
</p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px">绍兴市第一</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中学</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px">推优</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px">评选过程说明</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">1. </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">德育处下发</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">《</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">绍兴市第一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中学</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五好学生”</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">推优</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">评分表》，明确以下几点：</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1）明确“五好学生”评选背景及评比标准：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">以</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，坚持党</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">和</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">国家的教育方针政策，贯彻促进学生全面发展的教育理念，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">全面落实《中小学生守则》、中小学生日常行为规范、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">社</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">会</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px">主义核心价值观和学生核心素养发展要求，深化新时代学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">生</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">评价改革，进一步推</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中小学</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“五育并举”，培养“德智体</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">美劳</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”全面发展的学生</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">“五好学生”标准为思想好、学习好、身心好、审美好、劳动好。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2）评分表格中各必备条件，只要有一项不达到要求，一票否决；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3）各得分项每项最高为5分，根据学生情况酌情打分</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">，须填写相关情况说明，获奖须提供佐证材料</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4）加分项最高累计为15分，计入总分</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">，须填写相关情况说明，获奖须提供佐证材料</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">5）鼓励全体学生以各项评选要求为指引，努力进步。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学生自评：各学生根据表格内容，对照自身实际情况进行自评，且在</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“情况说明”中注明。自评分仅供参考，不作为最后评选结果。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">3.班主任审核与综合评定：</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">审核候选人必备条件是否符合，未达到要求者，一票否决；</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">4.推荐候选人填写《绍兴一中市直五好学生推荐表》及《绍兴市第一中学市直五好学生推荐评选评分表》并准备好相关事迹材料，于6月</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">26</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">日（周</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">一</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span><span style="font-family:宋体">17：00前将班级推荐名单及候选人纸质材料报送至德育处侯磊老师，电子版推荐表（word）同步提交至公共文件夹“德育处-2022学年市直五好学生推荐”，命名为班级+姓名（示例：101张三三）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">5.年级管委会审核，并根据比例人数向德育处上报“五好学生”名单。</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">6.学校评选组织委员会将在年段推荐的名单中择优进行市直及以上推荐，在校园网公示，无异议推选市直及“五好学生”。</span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:31px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:138%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">                             </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">              </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:138%;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:16px">                <span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴市第一中学德育处</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: 0px;">                                       </span><span style="text-align: right; text-indent: 267px; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px;">202</span><span style="text-align: right; text-indent: 267px; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px;">3</span><span style="text-align: right; text-indent: 267px; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px;">年</span><span style="text-align: right; text-indent: 267px; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px;">6</span><span style="text-align: right; text-indent: 267px; text-wrap: wrap; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px;">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: 0px;"></span></p><p>附：</p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/6/202306161055433052.docx" title="202306161055433052.docx">绍兴市第一中学市直“五好学生”推荐评选评分表.docx</a></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/6/202306161054575257.docx" title="202306161054575257.docx">绍兴一中市直五好学生推荐表.docx</a></p><p>
</p>
    
